WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.410
Your stop was far away – and you still got stopped out?

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.380
Spread: the gap between the buy and sell price.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:14.650
Step one: During news, the spread often gets many times wider.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.050
Step two: One short jump is enough – stop triggered.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.850
Step three: Check the spread. During news, better wait.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:30.200
Common mistake: Your short stop sits on the ask, not the chart.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.800
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:38.420
I show news trades live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
